{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39868","headline":"回文诗二首 一 · 徐夤","name":"回文诗二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"飞书一幅锦文回，恨写深情寄雁来。\n机上月残香阁掩，树梢烟澹绿窗开。\n霏霏雨罢歌终曲，漠漠云深酒满杯。\n归日几人行问卜，徽音想望倚高台。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐夤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39868.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39868","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}